<h2 local-id=3D"46f41857d3c1" id=3D"LegalEntities-FortraSalesforceBuild">Fo=
rtra Salesforce Build</h2>
<p local-id=3D"2366be8a5400"><strong>Renewals:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"933fa0a10763">Use currency and legal entity from legacy orgs=
. Default renewals to previous - always.</p>
<p local-id=3D"081088c04684"><strong>New Sales: </strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"7b39b0ab2a2f">1st - If Billing =E2=80=9CPlaces=E2=80=9D is P=
hilippines - Fortra LLC Default</p>
<p local-id=3D"beea5ca76a6f">2nd - Check =E2=80=9CPlaces=E2=80=9D of Billin=
g location if there is a Default Legal Entity and/or Default Currency - use=
 that.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d6d6199630a7">3rd - If not Philippines and no default listed=
 in billing =E2=80=9Cplaces=E2=80=9D then Legal Entity is based on Sales Re=
p location - Located in User account detail.</p>
<p local-id=3D"0b2c3e05f749"><strong>Rules: </strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"d1ac39fa1d13">Currency is based on default currency for the =
Legal Entity listed in below table, only certain currencies are options to =
each entity.</p>
<p local-id=3D"c884fea8751a">Philippines: Can only be billed from Fortra LL=
C or Fortra International PTY LTD</p>
