<h2 local-id=3D"c678694b3913" id=3D"LegalEntities-FutureFortraprojecttoacco=
mplishaftermovetoSalesforce:">Future Fortra project to accomplish after mov=
e to Salesforce:</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"81f8836e425c">
<li local-id=3D"4adc7e3dc772">
<p local-id=3D"d7c7a7792b7c">Regarding billing =E2=80=9CPlaces=E2=80=9D def=
ault Legal Entity and Currency, we unfortunately don=E2=80=99t have Legal E=
ntity stored at the account level today in legacy systems</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"91b18bfe915e">
<li local-id=3D"116bbee8d618">
<p local-id=3D"1102799ccf7b">We would suggest fields at the Places entity f=
or default Legal Entity and Currency - Once we move into salesforce these w=
ill be updated by customer operations (additional ask billing contact possi=
ble field.)</p></li>
</ol></li>
<li local-id=3D"8965dca588f4">
<p local-id=3D"89dcfd9136a4">Fortra LLC =E2=80=93 use this entity to bill U=
S sales, that were previously billed out of other US legal entities, out of=
 Fortra LLC (eg Tripwire, Inc)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f3ab9e6a779f">
<p local-id=3D"7e7b98d90c76">Fortra Canada - similar to Fortra LLC, move al=
l country=E2=80=99s sales to bill out of one legal entity in the country (e=
g Terranova Worldwide Corp)</p></li>
</ul>
    </div>
